$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Synthesis of
(2R,5R)-3-methyl-5-phenyl-2-(trifluoromethyl)-5,6-dihydro-2H-1,4-oxazin-2-ol,
2a. By means of general procedure B, from 268 mg (1.42 mmol) of 1a,1 265
mg of 2a were obtained as a white solid (72% yield). General Procedure
for the addition of TMSCF3 (General Procedure B). Synthesis of
(2R,5R)-3-phenethyl-5-phenyl-2-(trifluoromethyl)-5,6-dihydro-2H-1,4-oxazin-2-ol,
2b. By means of general procedure B, from 107 mg (0.38 mmol) of 1b, 100
mg of 2b were obtained as a white solid (75% yield). Rf: 0.12
(hexane/EtOAc, 7:1). mp: 131-133 °C. [α]25D −51.1 (c 1.4, EtOAc). 1H NMR
(CD3COCD3) δ 2.92-3.13 (m, 4H), 3.41 (t, J = 10.8 Hz, 1H), 4.07 (dd, J =
11.1, 4.7 Hz, 1H), 4.61-4.71 (m, 1H), 7.08 (br, 1H), 7.14-7.40 (m, 10H).
13C NMR (CD3COCD3) δ 33.3 (q, 4JCF = 2.2 Hz), 37.3, 61.0, 66.0, 91.1 (q,
2JCF = 32.5 Hz), 124.4 (q, 1JCF = 287.5 Hz), 127.6, 129.1, 129.1, 130.2,
130.2, 141.4, 143.7, 165.7. 19F NMR (CDCl3) δ −82.2 (s, 3F). HRMS (EI)
calcd for C19H18F3NO2 [M]+: 349.1290; found: 349.1281.
