$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Synthesis of
(2R,5R)-3-methyl-5-phenyl-2-(trifluoromethyl)-5,6-dihydro-2H-1,4-oxazin-2-ol,
2a. By means of general procedure B, from 268 mg (1.42 mmol) of 1a,1 265
mg of 2a were obtained as a white solid (72% yield). General Procedure
for the addition of TMSCF3 (General Procedure B). Synthesis of methyl
3-((2R,5R)-2-hydroxy-5-phenyl-2-(trifluoromethyl)-5,6-dihydro-2H-1,4-oxazin-3-yl)propanoate,
2c. By means of general procedure B, from 512 mg (2.07 mmol) of 1c,2 508
mg of 2c were obtained as a white solid (74% yield). Rf: 0.40
(hexane/EtOAc, 7:1).mp: 95-97 °C. [α]25D −53.4 (c 1.1, CHCl3). 1H NMR
(CDCl3) δ 2.48-2.64 (m, 1H), 2.64-2.77 (m, 1H), 3.00-3.23 (m, 2H), 3.42
(t, J = 11.1 Hz, 1H), 3.75 (s, 3H), 4.04 (dd, J = 11.4, 4.6 Hz, 1H), 4.63
(dt, J = 9.9, 8.4 Hz, 1H), 6.02 (s, 1H), 7.14-7.19 (m, 2H), 7.29-7.40 (m,
3H). 13C NMR (CDCl3) δ 27.8, 31.2, 52.4, 59.3, 64.0, 89.3 (q, 2JCF = 33.2
Hz), 121.9 (q, 1JCF = 286.8 Hz), 126.9, 127.7, 128.6, 138.7, 164.1,
176.0. 19F NMR (CDCl3) δ −81.5 (s, 3F). HRMS (EI) calcd for C15H16F3NO4
[M]+: 331.1031; found: 331.1034.
