$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of
(2R,5R)-3-methyl-5-phenyl-2-(trifluoromethyl)-5,6-dihydro-2H-1,4-oxazin-2-ol,
2a. By means of general procedure B, from 268 mg (1.42 mmol) of 1a,1 265
mg of 2a were obtained as a white solid (72% yield). General Procedure
for the addition of TMSCF3 (General Procedure B). TMSCF3 (2 equiv) and
TASF (0.5 equiv) were added to a cold (0° C) solution of imino lactone (1
equiv) in THF (0.1 M). After stirring for 5 h at rt, the reaction was
quenched with sat. aq NH4Cl and stirred at rt for 3 h, the aqueous layer
was then extracted with EtOAc (3x), and the combined organic layers were
dried over Na2SO4. The filtrate was concentrated and purified by means of
flash chromatography on silica gel with the appropriate solvents as
eluent. Rf: 0.21 (hexane/EtOAc, 7:1). mp: 138-139 °C. [α]25D −40.5 (c
1.0, MeOH). 1H NMR (CD3COCD3) δ 2.20-2.24 (m, 3H), 3.46 (t, J = 10.8 Hz,
1H), 4.05 (dd, J = 11.2, 4.6 Hz, 1H), 4.56-4.62 (m, 1H), 7.03 (br, 1H),
7.27-7.38 (m, 5H). 13C NMR (CD3OD) δ 22.5 (q, 4JCF = 2.4 Hz), 61.1, 65.2,
90.7 (q, 2JCF = 32.4 Hz), 123.7 (q, 1JCF = 285.4 Hz), 128.5, 129.0,
129.8, 140.1, 166.1. 19F NMR (CD3COCD3) δ −82.3 (s, 3F). HRMS (EI) calcd
for C12H12F3NO2 [M]+: 259.0820; found: 259.0765.
