$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Synthesis of
(2R,5R)-3-methyl-5-phenyl-2-(trifluoromethyl)-5,6-dihydro-2H-1,4-oxazin-2-ol,
2a. By means of general procedure B, from 268 mg (1.42 mmol) of 1a,1 265
mg of 2a were obtained as a white solid (72% yield). General Procedure
for the addition of TMSCF3 (General Procedure B). Synthesis of
(2R,3S)-3-(benzyl((R)-2-hydroxy-1-phenylethyl)amino)-1,1,1-trifluorobutan-2-ol,
9a. By means of general procedure B with TBAT (1.1 equiv) as the
activator, from 142 mg (0.505 mmol) of 8a, 124 mg of the corresponding
trifluoromethyl lactols (88:12 mixture of diastereoisomers as determined
with the aid of 19F NMR) were obtained as a colorless oil (70% yield).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, 88:12 diastereomeric mixt.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM An Efficient Entry to Optically Active anti- and
syn-β-Amino-α-trifluoromethyl Alcohols
