$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2, 2-Bis(polyfluoroalkyl)chroman-4-ones 4a-f,
10, and 15: General1,4-Trifluoromethylation Procedure.Chromone 1 or 9 (5
mmol) and (trifluoromethyl)trimethylsilane (1.0 g, 7 mmol) were dissolved
in dry THF (15 mL) and cooled to-25 to-30 °C, and a catalytic amount of
anhydrous Me 4 NF (20 mg) was added (solution changed from colorless to
yellow). The reaction mixture was left to stand with stirring at that
temperature for 24h. compound no 2.Yield 99%..(RF=CF3).
